{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a fateful day, you awaken ... in a world that feels utterly foreign to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is where you make a surprising realization:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are... Death?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why <strong>you</strong> of all people? And what even happened in the first place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386750/extras/3c584c5ca0e101abf691a15fe3befc3d.poster.avif?t=1755670041\" width=780 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386750/extras/3c584c5ca0e101abf691a15fe3befc3d.webm?t=1755670041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386750/extras/3c584c5ca0e101abf691a15fe3befc3d.mp4?t=1755670041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A TRUSTY COMPANION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A talking sword? A wise mentor? <strong>Think again!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only a Pig stands by your side! \ud83d\udc37</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You set off together - <strong>But soon a horrible conundrum arises...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386750/extras/8f5232e7b6de2dab7b671da52c440921.poster.avif?t=1755670041\" width=780 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386750/extras/8f5232e7b6de2dab7b671da52c440921.webm?t=1755670041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386750/extras/8f5232e7b6de2dab7b671da52c440921.mp4?t=1755670041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>... No one is able to die anymore?!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long will a world without death be able to last?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DUNGEONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find answers, you make your way through perilous dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not every problem can be solved with a scythe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only those who pay close attention will find a path to the deepest parts of the dungeon and closer to evil's root.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386750/extras/419a22c378db0fc5b909dd1c230eedc0.poster.avif?t=1755670041\" width=780 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386750/extras/419a22c378db0fc5b909dd1c230eedc0.webm?t=1755670041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386750/extras/419a22c378db0fc5b909dd1c230eedc0.mp4?t=1755670041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious creatures lurk in the depths ... scheming to obstruct your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do they keep guard over the lost souls?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... Or are they indeed the reason that nobody may ever die again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386750/extras/bd87dcf00d92ec2a08c743ebc27e62de.poster.avif?t=1755670041\" width=780 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386750/extras/bd87dcf00d92ec2a08c743ebc27e62de.webm?t=1755670041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386750/extras/bd87dcf00d92ec2a08c743ebc27e62de.mp4?t=1755670041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Don the Grim Reaper's cape and find out what it truly means to be Death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can pet the Pig ... <strong>and play as it???</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a beautiful world filled with secrets and discover its truly unique landscapes! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Delve into <strong>five</strong> challenging dungeons and face their riddles, traps and secrets! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > From tiny creatures to giant bosses - every battle will challenge you in new ways!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every character you meet will develop and change throughout the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A gripping tale about death and the many ways we choose to deal with it.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1386750?t=1755670041","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386750/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755670041","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386750/1cbb4cb7543f092f64ccc582791e56165a7f5d44/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755670041","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386750/1cbb4cb7543f092f64ccc582791e56165a7f5d44/